Error: Jet.CallMarkRequired: `grow` changes `items`, so the call writes `^items`
  --> Tests/UI/e0228_call_mark_required.jet:7:33
    |
  7 | relay: fn(items: ^[Int]) { grow(items) }
    |                                 ^^^^^
 Why: `grow: fn(items: ^[Int])` changes this input, and every call writes `^` before a named argument it changes
 Fix: Write `^items`, or run `jet fmt` / `jet fix`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.CallMarkRequired

