Error: Jet.CallMarkRequired: `archive` takes `title`, so its mark is `^^`, not `^`
  --> Tests/UI/e0228_call_mark_required.jet:16:21
    |
 16 |     print("{archive(^title)} {st.items.len()}")
    |                     ^
 Why: `archive: fn(title: ^^String)` takes this input rather than changing it in place; omit the mark or write `^^`
 Fix: Write `^^title` or remove `^`
